{"data": [{"author_id": "2451223458", "created_at": "2026-11-02T23:25:25.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117397698227921229"], "id": "2117397698227921229", "in_reply_to_user_id": "50609160", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 7, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2117396131588309449", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@stanmarion why a link or a button, though? i'm not sure i get it; why can't my Dot call a checkout tool? why do you *need* the user to manually click on anything?", "url": "https://x.com/mxstbr/status/2117397698227921229"}, {"author_id": "1838514970306449408", "created_at": "2026-11-02T23:24:00.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117397341804396758"], "id": "2117397341804396758", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 1, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "The real bottleneck for AI agents isn't tech. It's human attention. Humans max out at 5 sessions (I personally can only handle 1 lol). \n\nWading through endless Codex iterations is a nightmare.\n\nThat's why the race is on: Grok (Bot), OpenAI (Dots), Claude (Duet), DeepSeek", "url": "https://x.com/Mariko9902/status/2117397341804396758"}, {"author_id": "2084427925391015936", "created_at": "2026-11-02T23:22:20.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117396921866179008"], "id": "2117396921866179008", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 3, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": ". @OpenAIDevs Please let me have a left sidebar icon to jump right to my Dot. Right below the Home icon. Please and thank you!", "url": "https://x.com/MrQuiyst/status/2117396921866179008"}, {"author_id": "137776770", "created_at": "2026-11-02T23:21:12.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117396638834508100"], "id": "2117396638834508100", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1953337039510003712", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 13, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2117283124833055196", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@thsottiaux Why my dot appears and disappears randomly from my sidebar?", "url": "https://x.com/GustavoValverde/status/2117396638834508100"}, {"author_id": "1429581117758246921", "created_at": "2026-11-02T23:00:37.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117391459368190177"], "id": "2117391459368190177", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1953337039510003712", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 28, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2117110907255857227", "type": "quoted"}, {"id": "2117283124833055196", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@thsottiaux I reviewed my whole experience with my dot right here https://t.co/vmMZ83GNNe", "url": "https://x.com/anthonylopez316/status/2117391459368190177"}, {"author_id": "1192091185", "created_at": "2026-11-02T22:51:05.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117389060708892838"], "id": "2117389060708892838", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1953337039510003712", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 28, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2117283124833055196", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@thsottiaux Why can't I have a custom profile picture on my dot? If you want me to show it off to anyone it can't look the way it does now.", "url": "https://x.com/loftwah/status/2117389060708892838"}, {"author_id": "17690866", "created_at": "2026-11-02T22:14:23.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117379822917922857"], "id": "2117379822917922857", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 61, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Does anyone know how to map calling my Dot to a button on the Codex Micro Controller from ChatGPT?\n\nThere is a voice chat feature, which I used all the time - but now I am using Dot I need to be able to talk with her easier, and the Voice Chat feature doesn't include her context.", "url": "https://x.com/iambenslater/status/2117379822917922857"}, {"author_id": "111400702", "created_at": "2026-11-02T21:59:20.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117376033964048567"], "id": "2117376033964048567", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 24, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Should you be scrambling to set up personal AI agents like Grokbot, OpenAI dots, or Claude Duet? When should engineering lead agentic adoption, and when should agentic adoption lead to engineering?\n\nWhat about security, reliability, scalability, and consistency... How does that", "url": "https://x.com/fountainwire/status/2117376033964048567"}, {"author_id": "754514752735358977", "created_at": "2026-11-02T21:57:02.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117375458765344838"], "id": "2117375458765344838", "in_reply_to_user_id": "40393376", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 4, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2117363995216658788", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@dxiaolong true! yeah losing that and then the whole point of it is to be able to feed the info when its fresh, honeslty i give everything a chance but i turn back to using my Dot everytime to get stuff done", "url": "https://x.com/Astrob0i91/status/2117375458765344838"}, {"author_id": "1485615001847177222", "created_at": "2026-11-02T21:56:53.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117375418294538750"], "id": "2117375418294538750", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1953337039510003712", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 21, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2117283124833055196", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@thsottiaux Where is my dot???", "url": "https://x.com/Andrea51660828/status/2117375418294538750"}, {"author_id": "582865063", "created_at": "2026-11-02T21:54:51.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117374909450215777"], "id": "2117374909450215777", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1953337039510003712", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 54, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2117283355427495983", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@thsottiaux Is that why sometime my dot is super smart and other time answers like a freaking dumbass and doesn\u2019t seem to use any reasoning?", "url": "https://x.com/Silver_Aga/status/2117374909450215777"}, {"author_id": "1589923348821118978", "created_at": "2026-11-02T21:46:29.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117372801971867710"], "id": "2117372801971867710", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 32, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2117283124833055196", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "I made my dot less retarded by asking it to write all of its responsibilities in a Space document then removing all of it and starting from scratch. https://t.co/1wPIR6SZrL", "url": "https://x.com/oxydotsol/status/2117372801971867710"}, {"author_id": "1702335281360433152", "created_at": "2026-11-02T21:39:43.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117371098907971900"], "id": "2117371098907971900", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 117, "like_count": 4, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 3}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2116221174120354032", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "\u26a0\ufe0f\u26a0\ufe0fREMINDER\u26a0\ufe0f\u26a0\ufe0f\n\nTo my $BNKR &amp; #StreetHood Fam:\n\nToday, 4PM PT, in about 2.5 hours from now: \n\nLIVE @musegod_rh Walkthrough in the official MUSEGOD Discord\n(https://t.co/8JIZ0acxn1)\n\nWe will learn how to set up your muse as an agent of its own, this includes:\n\n- Give your muse https://t.co/FHEBjH2osq", "url": "https://x.com/0xBOTO/status/2117371098907971900"}, {"author_id": "71741828", "created_at": "2026-11-02T21:36:31.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117370291856818663"], "id": "2117370291856818663", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1168804909514231809", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 4, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2116415518588707075", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@kyimoemin @airesearch12 How? you give AI your phone number. With the number you get from https://t.co/sfh0J6xY4d we basically support ANY AI agent, from chatgpt dots to claude to grok bot. your agent rings your iphone like a normal call, even on a drive, and your answer comes back to it as text", "url": "https://x.com/soztetik/status/2117370291856818663"}, {"author_id": "894523628204814336", "created_at": "2026-11-02T21:33:38.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117369567743734045"], "id": "2117369567743734045", "in_reply_to_user_id": "2579060756", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 8, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2117244744824951104", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@ryanwinchester @theo I just tried it with my dot agent and he got it wrong. I'm flabbergasted", "url": "https://x.com/JB_Cartier/status/2117369567743734045"}, {"author_id": "74284328", "created_at": "2026-11-02T21:24:54.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117367368204841131"], "id": "2117367368204841131", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 37, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "I can add all my emails to @ChatGPT dots plugins but can\u2019t add more than 3 email accounts for @claudeai Duet? Please fix this why is it limited to 3 accounts? @ClaudeDevs @bcherny @DarioAmodei", "url": "https://x.com/JaeHokes/status/2117367368204841131"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2117364440995610624"]}, "author_id": "1064576982040674305", "created_at": "2026-11-02T21:14:29.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117364749176324354"], "id": "2117364749176324354", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 206, "like_count": 2, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Absolutely DEMONIC line up, fuck you Yabuli, fuck you Evernight son, Hoolay you're fine my DoT just sucks (Lord almighty get me that Jiaoqiu LC NOW) https://t.co/MjbhcJLX7G", "url": "https://x.com/Raviollies/status/2117364749176324354"}, {"author_id": "2546515693", "created_at": "2026-11-02T21:03:36.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117362011264917536"], "id": "2117362011264917536", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 10, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Why is my Dot suddenly saying \"we\" and \"us\" when referencing work it did?", "url": "https://x.com/DerekColling1/status/2117362011264917536"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2117360145743417344"]}, "author_id": "260109127", "created_at": "2026-11-02T20:58:15.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117360661693100333"], "id": "2117360661693100333", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 27, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Am I the only one who sees those all the time (and they constantly fail)?\nMy dot managed Codex agents seem to lose their @Cloudflare @CloudflareDev connection constantly, and clicking the button often does nothing. /cc @thsottiaux https://t.co/5xSaIBbCd0", "url": "https://x.com/kkozmic/status/2117360661693100333"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2117358097102508032"]}, "author_id": "2081190615006552064", "created_at": "2026-11-02T20:48:05.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117358103880728746"], "id": "2117358103880728746", "public_